.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		Quantum ESPRESSO, PBE-D3(BJ), plane waves (60 Ry), 6x4x4 k-points, atoms relaxed in the fixed cell. This calculation shows a molecular crystal in which water molecules are held together by hydrogen bonds, each O-H pointing at the oxygen of a neighbouring molecule. Structure: ice XI (Cmc21, proton-ordered), COD 1566645 (Leadbetter 1985, D2O neutron diffraction, D replaced by H).
.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:application		QuantumESPRESSO
